# Container images

- Multi-stage build. The runtime stage has no build tools, runs as a non-root user, and uses a pinned base image.
- No secrets in the image: no build args or environment values that are secrets, and no copied env files. The ignore file excludes env files, dependency directories, and the version-control directory.
- One image for every environment. Inject environment values at run time.
- Tag with a commit id or a version, never `latest`.
- Scan the image before pushing a new base or a new dependency set.
- Push only when the user asks.
